 "differences": [
  "The deposit has no exclusion flags; the paper discarded some trials (66, 40, 41, 28, 36, 77 and 56 in Experiments 1-7) for equipment failure or uncertain contact times, but which ones is not in the deposit, so excluded_by_authors is False in every row.",
  "Experiment 6 has 8 participant folders and 528 recordings in the deposit; the paper reports 7 participants (P5-P7, P9, P11, P13, P14) and 462 trials. The extra folder is labelled with a number the paper does not list for Experiment 6. It is released as in the deposit and no Experiment 6 count was used as a check.",
  "One recording starts with a row stamped 2210 ms followed by rows from 20 ms; it is kept as shared.",
  "The paper's gaze biases and contact asynchronies are computed from event detection (thresholds, contact times) that the deposit does not provide, so they were not rebuilt; the published checks are counts of participants and trials, replications and the sampling rate."
